Changelog: 05-11-2026 13:39:05

Added. DatStation: the BC250 Bazzite Suite's Bazzite DatStation, feature for feature, on the suite's handheld
window. A front page of tiles opens the PlayStation quiz against the clock (the categories and the quick quiz,
answers on the d-pad and A, X skip, Y pause, LB the music, B twice to leave a round, the results with their review,
star and trophy, and the next round after a perfect one), the consoles' history (A opens pictures of a console on
the web), every system software release and the region codes (a list, and the text beside it to scroll), Sony's
user guides in the browser, PS News from the PlayStation.Blog feed (loaded off the window's thread when the page
opens; only PlayStation's own links are opened) and the quiz scores and trophies (X twice clears them), kept in
scores.json in the app's folder. Y on the front page adds the app to Steam's library as a non-Steam game, or brings
its entry up to date, and X takes it out on a second press.
